; Item action: the final parchment that starts the ending (room 24)
;
; The room item of room 24 (Satan !!!) at row 14, column 28 with flag $8534. It exists only after the chalice has been
; taken ($8521, set by #R$A734, is nonzero): before that the slot is skipped and nothing is drawn. When Jean touches
; it the flag becomes $FF, the room state becomes 3 (the ending sequence, #R$887B) and the slot is freed with sound
; effect 5; otherwise it draws frame 0.
;
; F Carry set when Jean's box overlaps the item's box
; SP Slot address + 6 on entry (the RET of #R$A614 popped the action word at +4): the next stack word is the flag pointer (the action pops it); see #R$A5E9 for the slot layout
@label=ActionFinalScroll
c$A668 EX AF,AF'     ; keep the carry
 $A669 LD A,($8521)  ; $8521: the chalice has been taken
 $A66C OR A          ;
 $A66D JR NZ,$A676   ; taken: go on
; Entry point used by #R$A615 (door open, Jean not touching): go on with the next slot; SP is at slot + 6 (nothing has
; been popped).
@label=NextSlotSP6
@isub=LD HL,SLOT_SIZE-6
*$A66F LD HL,$0010   ;
 $A672 ADD HL,SP     ;
 $A673 JP $A5F0      ;
*$A676 POP HL        ; flag pointer
 $A677 EX AF,AF'     ; carry again
 $A678 JR NC,$A684   ;
@isub=LD (HL),ITEM_GONE
 $A67A LD (HL),$FF   ;
@isub=LD A,STATE_ENDING
 $A67C LD A,$03      ;
 $A67E LD ($850C),A  ;
 $A681 JP $A71F      ; sound, free the slot
*$A684 XOR A         ; frame 0
 $A685 JP $A7DB      ;
